    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard 6'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='900' maxwidth='1300' minheight='900' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98222' id='3' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='49385' x='50000' y='889'>
            <zone h='98222' id='6' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='49385' x='50000' y='889'>
              <zone h='6556' id='8' name='Top Performing Products By revenue' pane-specification-id='0' param='[federated.042lfkd0rqc4py103ezla0qwvlf5].[none:Category:nk]' type-v2='color' w='48923' x='50231' y='1222'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='764' forceUpdate='true' h='85778' id='15' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='48923' x='50231' y='7778'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>KEY 0BSERVATION:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>Every single product in the top 10 by revenue is Electronics: Noise Watch V1 leads at ₹191.6M, followed by Samsung Mobile V4, three boAt Headphones variants, two HP Laptop models, Noise Watch V7, and Apple iPhone V7. Combined, these ten products alone account for a meaningful share of total company revenue, concentrated in a category we already know runs a negative estimated margin.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>Why This Matters for Profitability:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>This chart converts an abstract category-level problem into a specific, fixable one. Knowing &quot;Electronics has negative margin&quot; doesn&apos;t tell anyone what to actually do on Monday morning. Knowing &quot;these ten named products are driving both the revenue and the margin loss&quot; does. A pricing or discount-depth review doesn&apos;t need to touch 2,000 products, it needs to start with this list of ten, since correcting their unit economics would move the entire Electronics margin figure more than any other single intervention. This is where profitability work becomes actionable rather than theoretical.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>Key Insights:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>Revenue concentration inside Electronics mirrors the concentration seen at the category level, it&apos;s not diffuse, it&apos;s a short list.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>These products are almost certainly the same ones carrying the deepest average discounts, tying this chart directly back to the discount-vs-margin finding.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>Any pricing correction here has outsized leverage, fixing ten SKUs can meaningfully shift company-wide profitability.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#e15759' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='3' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#e6ecf0' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone h='98222' id='5' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='49385' x='615' y='889'>
            <zone h='97999' id='7' name='Top Performing Products By revenue' w='49231' x='692' y='1000'>
              <layout-cache cell-count-h='10' non-cell-size-h='197' type-h='cell' type-w='fixed' />
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#499894' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#e2e6f0' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='27' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='26' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='97999' id='7' is-fixed='true' name='Top Performing Products By revenue' w='49231' x='692' y='1000'>
                  <layout-cache cell-count-h='10' non-cell-size-h='197' type-h='cell' type-w='fixed' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='6556' id='8' name='Top Performing Products By revenue' pane-specification-id='0' param='[federated.042lfkd0rqc4py103ezla0qwvlf5].[none:Category:nk]' type-v2='color' w='48923' x='50231' y='1222'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='764' forceUpdate='true' h='85778' id='15' type-v2='text' w='48923' x='50231' y='7778'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>KEY 0BSERVATION:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>Every single product in the top 10 by revenue is Electronics: Noise Watch V1 leads at ₹191.6M, followed by Samsung Mobile V4, three boAt Headphones variants, two HP Laptop models, Noise Watch V7, and Apple iPhone V7. Combined, these ten products alone account for a meaningful share of total company revenue, concentrated in a category we already know runs a negative estimated margin.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>Why This Matters for Profitability:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>This chart converts an abstract category-level problem into a specific, fixable one. Knowing &quot;Electronics has negative margin&quot; doesn&apos;t tell anyone what to actually do on Monday morning. Knowing &quot;these ten named products are driving both the revenue and the margin loss&quot; does. A pricing or discount-depth review doesn&apos;t need to touch 2,000 products, it needs to start with this list of ten, since correcting their unit economics would move the entire Electronics margin figure more than any other single intervention. This is where profitability work becomes actionable rather than theoretical.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>Key Insights:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>Revenue concentration inside Electronics mirrors the concentration seen at the category level, it&apos;s not diffuse, it&apos;s a short list.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>These products are almost certainly the same ones carrying the deepest average discounts, tying this chart directly back to the discount-vs-margin finding.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>Any pricing correction here has outsized leverage, fixing ten SKUs can meaningfully shift company-wide profitability.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{922CA95F-7085-4080-9929-D48E3CA419C2}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard 7'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='900' maxwidth='1300' minheight='900' minwidth='1300' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <datasources>
        <datasource caption='CUSTOMERS+' name='federated.042lfkd0rqc4py103ezla0qwvlf5' />
      </datasources>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.042lfkd0rqc4py103ezla0qwvlf5'>
