      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98222' id='3' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='49385' x='50000' y='889'>
            <zone h='97334' id='6' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='48769' x='50308' y='1333'>
              <zone h='28445' id='10' name='Stock value by brand' param='[federated.042lfkd0rqc4py103ezla0qwvlf5].[none:Category:nk]' type-v2='filter' w='48769' x='50308' y='1333'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='17667' id='11' name='Stock value by brand' pane-specification-id='0' param='[federated.042lfkd0rqc4py103ezla0qwvlf5].[none:Category:nk]' type-v2='color' w='48769' x='50308' y='29778'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='50000' id='16' type-v2='text' w='48769' x='50308' y='47445'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Algerian'>KEEY OBSER:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri'>Fashion, Beauty, and Home brands, Plum, Lakme, Mamaearth, Nivea, Dove, IKEA, Prestige, Philips, Godrej, Urban, dominate the upper and middle sections of this chart with healthy stock levels. Electronics brands, Apple, Samsung, boAt, sit at the bottom with disproportionately large stock bars relative to their category&apos;s known profitability problem.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri'>Why This Matters for Profitability:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri'>
Stock isn&apos;t just a logistics number, it&apos;s capital sitting on a shelf. When a brand with negative estimated margin, like the Electronics names here, holds stock volumes comparable to or larger than genuinely profitable brands, that represents money tied up in inventory that loses value with every unit sold. This chart shows the business hasn&apos;t yet adjusted purchasing or stocking decisions to reflect what the margin analysis already revealed, inventory strategy and profitability strategy are currently disconnected.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri'>Key Insights:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri'>Stock volume by brand doesn&apos;t correlate with margin health, Electronics brands are stocked heavily despite being the least profitable.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri'>This points to demand-driven purchasing decisions rather than profit-driven ones.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri'>Rebalancing stock investment toward proven, profitable brands would improve capital efficiency without needing new products or new customers.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#59a14f' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#eef1f3' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='98222' id='5' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='49385' x='615' y='889'>
