    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard 9'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='900' maxwidth='1700' minheight='900' minwidth='1700' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <datasources>
        <datasource caption='CUSTOMERS+' name='federated.042lfkd0rqc4py103ezla0qwvlf5' />
      </datasources>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.042lfkd0rqc4py103ezla0qwvlf5'>
        <column caption='Order Date' datatype='date' name='[Order_Date]' role='dimension' type='ordinal' />
        <column-instance column='[Order_Date]' derivation='Month' name='[mn:Order_Date:ok]' pivot='key' type='ordinal' />
      </datasource-dependencies>
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98222' id='3' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='49529' x='50000' y='889'>
            <zone h='98222' id='6' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='49529' x='50000' y='889'>
              <zone h='43445' id='8' name='Monthly Net Revenue Trend' param='[federated.042lfkd0rqc4py103ezla0qwvlf5].[mn:Order_Date:ok]' type-v2='filter' w='49059' x='50235' y='1333'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='50889' id='13' type-v2='text' w='49059' x='50235' y='44778'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='10' underline='true'>KEY INSIGHTS:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='10'>Revenue holds close to the average line across most of the period, peaking at ₹245.5M, with one clear trough of ₹212.9M in February, tied to a typical post-holiday seasonal demand slowdown.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='10'>Why This Matters for Profitability:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='10'>This chart&apos;s real value is what it rules out. If Electronics&apos; negative margin were a worsening trend, we&apos;d expect to see revenue or profitability decline visibly over time. It doesn&apos;t, revenue is essentially flat outside one seasonal dip. That tells us the margin problem identified elsewhere in this analysis is structural and embedded in current pricing and discount practice, not something drifting in a particular direction on its own. It also carries a practical warning: if a business instinctively discounts harder during a naturally slow month like February to &quot;make up&quot; for lower demand, that would only deepen the existing Electronics margin problem rather than fix it.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='10'>Key Insights:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='10'>The business shows revenue stability, not decline, meaning the profitability issue is a pricing structure problem, not a demand or momentum problem.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='10'>The February dip is explainable and predictable, not a red flag, useful for separating real risk from seasonal noise.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='10'>Time-based stability strengthens the case that fixing Electronics margin is a controllable, internal decision, not something dependent on external market recovery.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#499894' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#e9f0f1' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone h='98222' id='5' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='49529' x='471' y='889'>
            <zone h='98000' id='7' name='Monthly Net Revenue Trend' w='49411' x='530' y='1000'>
              <layout-cache minheight='220' type-h='scalable' type-w='fixed' />
              <zone-style>
